@host = http://localhost:8085
@submissionId = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
@challengeId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### 1. Lancer une vérification (202, asynchrone)
POST {{host}}/api/verifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "submissionId": "{{submissionId}}"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("verificationId", response.body.id);
%}

### 2. État / résultat (attendre le worker)
GET {{host}}/api/verifications/{{verificationId}}

### 3. Logs redactés
GET {{host}}/api/verifications/{{verificationId}}/logs

### 4. Analyse de similarité
POST {{host}}/api/similarity/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "submissionId": "{{submissionId}}",
  "challengeId": "{{challengeId}}"
}

### 5. Rapport de similarité calculé
GET {{host}}/api/similarity/{{submissionId}}

### 6. Résumé IA (503 tant que l'IA est désactivée)
POST {{host}}/api/ai/summarize/{{submissionId}}

### Supervision
GET {{host}}/actuator/health
